# Drone mode naming

The third drone state is **`LAST_OF_2028`**, not any `TEST_OF_*` variant.

## Required names

| Kind | Correct | Forbidden |
|------|---------|-----------|
| Enum / state | `LAST_OF_2028` | `TEST_OF_2028`, `TEST_OF_EE2028`, `TEST_OF_EE_2028` |
| Handler | `Handle_Last_Of_2028_Mode` | `Handle_EE2028_Mode`, `Handle_Test_Of_*` |
| Prose / docs | "Last of 2028" | "Test of EE2028", "Test of 2028" |

## Examples

```c
// ❌ BAD
case TEST_OF_EE2028:
    Handle_EE2028_Mode();

// ✅ GOOD
case LAST_OF_2028:
    Handle_Last_Of_2028_Mode();
```

If you see a forbidden name in a diff or existing file, rename it to the correct form before finishing the task.
